# The Gravy Boat: Thanksgiving's Ghost kind. A white porcelain gravy boat
# brimming with gravy, floating with no legs: drips of gravy hang where the
# Ghost's hem would be. Its spout points forward, its handle loops at the
# back, and the team's gold helmet sits at the back, so the gravy shows.
